<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Inscripción a Materias - Aula Virtual</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 min-h-screen flex flex-col">

    <!-- Header / Navbar -->
    <header class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 sticky top-0 z-50 px-6 py-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <span class="bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 text-white p-2 rounded-lg font-bold text-lg shadow-md shadow-blue-200">AV</span>
                <h1 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Aula Virtual</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">Conectado como <strong class="text-slate-800 font-semibold">{{currentUser}}</strong></span>
                <a href="/dashboard" class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700 transition">Volver al Panel</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="flex-grow max-w-4xl w-full mx-auto p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col space-y-6">
        
        <div class="flex flex-col space-y-2">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-2">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Inscripción a Materias</h2>
                {{#inscripcionActiva}}
                <span class="bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-semibold px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-200 shadow-sm flex items-center self-start sm:self-center">
                    <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full mr-2 animate-pulse"></span>
                    Período Activo: {{inscripcionAnio}} - {{inscripcionPeriodo}}
                </span>
                {{/inscripcionActiva}}
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Inscríbete directamente en las asignaturas de tu plan de estudios. Un administrador te asignará una comisión y horario posteriormente.</p>
        </div>

        {{^inscripcionActiva}}
        <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-800 p-4 rounded-xl text-sm shadow-sm flex items-center space-x-3">
            <span class="text-lg">⏳</span>
            <span>El periodo de inscripción a materias se encuentra cerrado actualmente. Ponte en contacto con administración si necesitas realizar algún cambio.</span>
        </div>
        {{/inscripcionActiva}}

        <!-- Alert messages -->
        {{#errorMessage}}
        <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 text-red-700 p-4 rounded-xl text-sm shadow-sm flex items-center space-x-3">
            <span class="text-lg">⚠️</span>
            <span>{{errorMessage}}</span>
        </div>
        {{/errorMessage}}

        {{#successMessage}}
        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 text-green-700 p-4 rounded-xl text-sm shadow-sm flex items-center space-x-3">
            <span class="text-lg">✓</span>
            <span>{{successMessage}}</span>
        </div>
        {{/successMessage}}

        {{#hasActiveEnrollments}}
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-4">
            <div class="space-y-1">
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-indigo-955 flex items-center">
                    <span class="mr-2">🎒</span> Comisión Colectiva
                </h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-indigo-700">
                    {{#currentCommissionName}}
                        Actualmente asignado a la <strong class="font-semibold text-indigo-900">{{currentCommissionName}}</strong> para las materias inscriptas.
                    {{/currentCommissionName}}
                    {{^currentCommissionName}}
                        Sin comisión asignada. Las inscripciones se asignarán automáticamente al inscribirte o puedes solicitar una comisión abajo.
                    {{/currentCommissionName}}
                </p>
                {{#hasPendingRequest}}
                <div class="mt-2 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 inline-flex items-center space-x-1.5 shadow-sm">
                    <span>⏳</span>
                    <span>Solicitud pendiente para cambiar a: <strong>{{pendingCommissionName}}</strong>. Un administrador la resolverá a la brevedad.</span>
                </div>
                {{/hasPendingRequest}}
            </div>
            
            {{^hasPendingRequest}}
                {{#inscripcionActiva}}
                <form action="/inscripcion/solicitar-cambio" method="post" class="w-full md:w-auto flex items-center gap-2">
                    <select name="nueva_comision" class="bg-white border border-slate-300 text-slate-700 text-xs rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500 transition duration-150 ease-in-out font-medium min-w-[160px]">
                        {{#commissionOptions}}
                        <option value="{{nombre}}" {{#selected}}selected{{/selected}}>{{nombre}}</option>
                        {{/commissionOptions}}
                    </select>
                    <button type="submit" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 active:bg-indigo-800 text-white font-semibold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-xs transition shadow-md shadow-indigo-100 whitespace-nowrap">
                        Solicitar cambio de comisión
                    </button>
                </form>
                {{/inscripcionActiva}}
            {{/hasPendingRequest}}
        </div>
        {{/hasActiveEnrollments}}

        <!-- Subjects Cards -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
            {{#subjects}}
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden p-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-4">
                <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
                    <div class="p-3 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm tracking-wide">
                        {{codigo}}
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-1">
                        <span class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase tracking-wide mr-2">{{anio}}° Año • {{periodo}}</span>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base leading-tight">{{nombre}}</h3>
                        
                        {{#inscrito}}
                            {{#has_comision}}
                            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 flex items-center">
                                <span class="mr-1.5">🕒</span> Asignado a: <strong class="text-slate-800 font-semibold ml-1">{{comision_nombre}} ({{comision_horario}})</strong>
                            </p>
                            {{/has_comision}}
                            {{^has_comision}}
                            <p class="text-xs text-amber-600 flex items-center">
                                <span class="mr-1.5">⏳</span> Inscripto (Comisión pendiente de asignación)
                            </p>
                            {{/has_comision}}
                        {{/inscrito}}
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div>
                    {{#inscrito}}
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center bg-green-50 text-green-700 text-xs font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-green-200 shadow-sm">
                        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full mr-2"></span>
                        Inscripto
                    </span>
                    {{/inscrito}}
                    {{^inscrito}}
                        {{#inscripcionActiva}}
                        <form action="/inscripcion" method="post">
                            <input type="hidden" name="id_materia" value="{{id}}">
                            <button type="submit" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 active:bg-indigo-800 text-white font-semibold py-2.5 px-5 rounded-xl text-xs transition shadow-md shadow-indigo-100 whitespace-nowrap">
                                Inscribirse a Materia
                            </button>
                        </form>
                        {{/inscripcionActiva}}
                        {{^inscripcionActiva}}
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center bg-slate-100 text-slate-400 text-xs font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm cursor-not-allowed">
                            Inscripción Cerrada
                        </span>
                        {{/inscripcionActiva}}
                    {{/inscrito}}
                </div>
            </div>
            {{/subjects}}
            {{^subjects}}
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-12 text-center text-slate-400">
                <p class="text-sm font-medium">No hay materias registradas en el sistema escolar en este momento.</p>
            </div>
            {{/subjects}}
        </div>

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-white border-t border-slate-200 py-6 px-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
        <p>&copy; 2026 Aula Virtual - Trabajo Integrador IS2.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
